// Prompt construction for the Brand Builder.
//
// Consistency strategy: we first generate (or accept an upload of) a single
// "hero" reference packshot of the product. Every medium is then generated by
// handing that exact image back to Nano-Banana as an input, together with a
// "product lock" block that pins down shape, colours, label and logo. The model
// is asked to composite the *same* object into each scene rather than reinvent it.

